Two facts worth stating here because they bite immediately, not because this
repo owns them:

- Every ContainerHub PowerShell module declares `#requires -Version 7.0`, so the
  entry scripts do too — launch with `pwsh`, never `powershell`.
- Workflows resolve ContainerHub's composite actions at `@main`, so an upstream
  change a workflow depends on must be pushed **before** the consumer change.

